---
description: Prevent overly large Tailwind border radius in the landing app
alwaysApply: true
---

# No `rounded-4xl`

Do not use Tailwind's `rounded-4xl` utility anywhere in this app.

- Prefer `rounded-2xl` for cards, panels, FAQ items, pricing blocks, and similar UI surfaces.
- Use smaller radii such as `rounded-xl`, `rounded-lg`, or `rounded-md` when the component needs a tighter shape.
- Existing `rounded-4xl` classes should be replaced instead of copied into new code.

```tsx
// Bad
<div className="rounded-4xl border p-6" />

// Good
<div className="rounded-2xl border p-6" />
```
